<title>PHILIPPINES: CADP unit bags Vietnam consultancy deal.</title>
<headline>CADP unit bags Vietnam consultancy deal.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Central Azucarera Don Pedro said on Wednesday its subsidiary CADP Consultancy Services had signed a consultancy contract for a sugar refinery in Vietnam.</p>
<p>It said the consultancy firm had been commissioned to train personnel for an integrated raw sugar factory and refinery of Vietnam Taiwan Sugar Corp in northern Vietnam.</p>
<p>CADP also said negotiations for other contracts are ongoing, especially for sugar companies in Vietnam and south Sulawesi in Indonesia.</p>
<p>Among them is a contract with a Japanese firm to open another sugar refinery in northern Vietnam.</p>
<p>&quot;Negotiations are underway for detailed engineering, construction supervision, training of personnel and start-up of the factory,&quot; it added.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
